then say it!","expectedText":"Annuler ma réservation","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276046,"_nanoseconds":566000000}},{"id":"oAroPsjNOE5VP6MTazDA","level":"a2","lesson":11,"part":6,"type":"text","name":"a2-l11-p06-b1","partTitle":"Say it 4/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.7rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>À emporter</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0;\">to take away</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"À emporter","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276046,"_nanoseconds":567000000}},{"id":"9CQhEECqhwAwntCsRAob","level":"a2","lesson":11,"part":7,"type":"text","name":"a2-l11-p07-b1","partTitle":"Listen to the conversation","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"opacity:.8;\">Read and listen to the whole conversation first. You play the “You” part next.</p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Restaurant Le Palmier, bonsoir.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Restaurant Le Palmier, good evening.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Bonsoir, je voudrais réserver une table pour quatre personnes.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Good evening, I would like to book a table for four people.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Pour quel jour ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">For which day?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Vendredi, à vingt heures, si possible.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Friday at eight, if possible.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>D'accord. C'est à quel nom ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">All right. What name is it under?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Mensah, M, E, N, S, A, H.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Mensah, M, E, N, S, A, H.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>C'est noté. Vous voulez une table en terrasse ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Noted. Would you like a terrace table?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Oui, volontiers. Merci, à vendredi !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Yes, gladly. Thank you, see you Friday!</span></p>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276046,"_nanoseconds":616000000}},{"id":"hazg92gC0RHlzOV3U3Mu","level":"a2","lesson":11,"part":8,"type":"text","name":"a2-l11-p08-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 1/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Restaurant Le Palmier, bonsoir.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Restaurant Le Palmier, good evening.</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">Bonsoir, je voudrais réserver une table pour quatre personnes.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Good evening, I would like to book a table for four people.</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"Bonsoir, je voudrais réserver une table pour quatre personnes.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276047,"_nanoseconds":112000000}},{"id":"teXKjhSkQ25dKYzoGJjq","level":"a2","lesson":11,"part":9,"type":"text","name":"a2-l11-p09-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 2/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Pour quel jour ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">For which day?</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">Vendredi, à vingt heures, si possible.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Friday at eight, if possible.</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"Vendredi, à vingt heures, si possible.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276047,"_nanoseconds":94000000}},{"id":"tSxyzr3cCcxRf4jp8Iu4","level":"a2","lesson":11,"part":10,"type":"text","name":"a2-l11-p10-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 3/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>D'accord. C'est à quel nom ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">All right. What name is it under?</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">Mensah, M, E, N, S, A, H.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Mensah, M, E, N, S, A, H.</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"Mensah, M, E, N, S, A, H.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276047,"_nanoseconds":142000000}},{"id":"Z4vsGV4xtbzx2DGPcR8M","level":"a2","lesson":11,"part":11,"type":"text","name":"a2-l11-p11-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 4/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>C'est noté. Vous voulez une table en terrasse ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Noted. Would you like a terrace table?</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">Oui, volontiers. Merci, à vendredi !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Yes, gladly. Thank you, see you Friday!</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"Oui, volontiers. Merci, à vendredi !","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276047,"_nanoseconds":104000000}},{"id":"LsPJzUppbheqaQJPsU6w","level":"a2","lesson":11,"part":12,"type":"text","name":"a2-l11-p12-b1","partTitle":"Speak freely","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.4rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>Réservez une table au restaurant.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0 0 10px;\">Book a table at the restaurant.</p><p><b>Book a table: number of people, day, time and name.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.7;\">For example: “Je voudrais réserver une table pour trois personnes samedi à vingt heures, au nom de Mensah.”</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Now it's your turn to speak!","expectedText":"Je voudrais réserver une table pour trois personnes samedi à vingt heures, au nom de Mensah.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276047,"_nanoseconds":518000000}},{"id":"vyTNat7wWajHWahZAoH6","level":"a2","lesson":11,"part":13,"type":"text","name":"a2-l11-p13-b1","partTitle":"Well done","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:64px;line-height:1.1;\">🍷</div><p><b>Table booked!</b></p></div><p style=\"line-height:1.6;\">🧑‍🏫 You can book a table by phone and confirm the details. Very practical!</p>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276047,"_nanoseconds":537000000}}]